        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: EverTrust Bank\n- Places: Puente Hills Mall\n- Films: Back to the Future\n- People: Michael J. Fox, Christopher Lloyd\n\nFacts:\n- EverTrust Bank, also written as Ever Trust Bank and Evertrust Bank in local Chinese media advertisements, is an overseas Chinese bank in the United States.\n- In 1985, Puente Hills Mall served as the filming site for the Twin Pines Mall and Lone Pine Mall in the movie Back to the Future.\n- The 1985 movie Back to the Future starred Michael J. Fox and Christopher Lloyd.",
